    "Details": "The Prime configuration of the Lindworm OmniProtoMech pairs a Quad Melee Weapon System with an LRM-2 launcher, which is intended for harassing fire against its enemies. The Lindworm keeps a very high top speed while carrying much heavier armor than the Basilisk Quad it replaced, which makes it far more survivable and more effective at using its Electric Discharge ProtoMech Armor. It has also taken over many roles of fast light 'Mechs.\n\n<b><color=#e62e00>Quirk: OmniProtoMech</color></b>\n\n<b><color=#e62e00>Drop Cost Multiplier: 0.986</color></b>",
